Focus is a new format for office rent.
We combine more than 150 offices of different sizes with different organization of the workspace which are concentrated in the best locations of the city.
Choosing us in addition to your office space you get many additional services such as all necessary amount of furniture, access to common areas (lounge area, terrace, meeting rooms, kitchen, reception area, print zone), administrator service, security system.
Our goal is to provide all conditions when you can concentrate directly on your business and don’t waste your time on everyday office support.
We work on the principle of "one-stop service” when to solve all issues related to your office space you can contact the administrator or leave a request in our application.
 - print documents;
 - prepare a meeting room for a meeting;
 - meet your guests;
 - lead them to the office or to the meeting room;
 - treat you with coffee or tea;
 - call the courier;
 - handle your correspondence.
All your queries will be completed instantly!
